{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-variants}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7486afe5bb78a3bda36520241bdc619119ea9f5ec711682f6e996e859f088b3e", "source_text": "Variants on descending properties", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7dbb993924edeeb02595bcd5b00425ec2ad67e11f79ac9f7a72de55b84bb52ff", "unit_id": "tag:06QL:title"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-descent-finiteness-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:66293a9607c0c3e303fd5799cd0cf9961ecec2c4d9e4277cebef9ab67814b348", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nSometimes one can descend properties, which are not local.\nWe put results of this kind in this section. See also\nSection <REF_0001>\non descending properties of morphisms,\nsuch as smoothness.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:711955c9e724070ec823d2737b24750c2d49dbcb4e9f2c9c9584571ae00d6e19", "unit_id": "tag:06QL:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descend-reduced}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4bb35b1434384eb10b7de12957016ef67c0d52c3324b0539b69001d886b6757e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5da4e2a0898ed9ac56040561a2907b6482c6dfd67cffe9fe27fd953fbb7d4bd1", "source_text": "If <MATH_0001> is a flat and surjective morphism of schemes\nand <MATH_0002> is reduced, then <MATH_0003> is reduced.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a1fed968db01eb547fedae2185e5af15826b7491e2d2dbbed31a3579ad20d124", "unit_id": "tag:06QM:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-definition-reduced}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-descent-reduced}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0f77da06f99c32252992c1158aca4bfe2764dad698466de740bf52d9bc2ce136", "source_text": "The result follows by looking at local rings\n(Schemes, Definition <REF_0001>)\nand\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e04e1952398f4d380c1b97b9eda9a001bf4ec1d740ad644863f582b1c26905df", "unit_id": "tag:06QM:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descend-regular}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f76d60b89af8dfad3b17e82664697512aeb4063e23e6cfec99e9028a8a5167fd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4b72016865908b4e4dd5d982712e4262dc9d9ff8dc4bde8b01227cd021685f3d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic spaces.\nIf <MATH_0002> is locally of finite presentation, flat, and surjective and\n<MATH_0003> is regular, then <MATH_0004> is regular.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e5c5901fcc5ca23d30221e4251e922a7e1a588bad4792a57373c27d7f6d9e9b0", "unit_id": "tag:06QN:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06QL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$A$", "MATH_0004": "$A$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-descent-Noetherian}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-under-regular}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8e97c7b04b084e5b015d780dc64204e2e5878db59dce8fe05977c8ffbd9cfc88", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8e1eaa9fc87310c994913ca9b3226564b628be311e0b8fd3851043a0c79e87da", "source_text": "This lemma reduces to the following algebra statement: If <MATH_0001> is\na faithfully flat, finitely presented ring homomorphism with <MATH_0002> Noetherian\nand regular, then <MATH_0003> is Noetherian and regular. We see that\n<MATH_0004> is Noetherian by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>\nand regular by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:79d75ce388e6817ec9ab83822ca5803e4d68909b0058601ce987b3a091f4a2db", "unit_id": "tag:06QN:proof"}
